<title>UK: NSW Treasury sets A$200 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>NSW Treasury sets A$200 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW SOUTH WALES TREASURY CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  A$200 MLN COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    07.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.925    PAY DATE    07.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
